  "body": "I wrote an Userscript to prevent some inline scripts that are added dynamically to the page to run and replace them with a modified version. I did that by subscribing the `beforescriptexecute` event and using `preventDefault`.\r\n\r\nIt works perfectly in Firefox with Greasemonkey, but I learnt about #943 and the fact that it is not actually in the spec. So and I'm wondering how will I support browsers other than Firefox?",
